    <string name="empty_title">No stickers yet</string>
    <string name="empty_body">Capture stickers from TikTok with the bubble, or import them from a recording, the gallery or a link. Then select them and create a WhatsApp pack.</string>
    <string name="empty_step1">The easiest way: "Automatic capture from TikTok". Whatik shows a bubble over TikTok; when stickers are on screen tap the bubble and Whatik finds and adds them by itself.</string>
    <string name="empty_step2">Alternatively record the screen with the phone recorder and share the video with Whatik: moving stickers are detected on their own, press "Create all".</string>
    <string name="empty_step3">Got a direct link to a sticker (.awebp/.webp/.gif file) or to a page containing it? Use "From a link". Images already in the gallery are found by the automatic search.</string>
    <string name="empty_step4">Tap stickers to select them (or "Select all") and press "Copy to WhatsApp": packs are created and opened in WhatsApp (3 to 30 stickers per pack).</string>
