    <string name="title_capture">Capture</string>
    <string name="capture_intro">Whatik shows a bubble over TikTok. Go where stickers are visible (a video, the sticker panel, a chat) and tap the bubble: a radial menu opens. "Point" lets you tap the sticker to capture: Whatik frames the zone, locks the screen for 8 seconds (so you cannot scroll by mistake), records at 20 frames per second, measures the loop length and works out whether the sticker is animated or still. "All" grabs every animated sticker on screen at once. "End" or a long-press on the bubble closes the session.</string>
